  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Duramax 15 is the most durable member of the NXT family. Reinforced with Abrasion Shields to protect its PU-bonded multifilament construction, it provides exceptional resistance to breakage while preserving the comfort, power and spin associated with NXT. Its thicker 1.40 mm gauge is ideal for frequent string breakers who still prefer the feel of a premium multifilament.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Duramax 15 是 NXT 系列中最耐打的版本。它采用 Abrasion Shields（耐磨护盾）强化 PU 多芯结构，大幅提升抗磨损和抗断线能力，同时依旧保留 NXT 系列舒适、力量与旋转的特点。1.40 毫米（15 Gauge）的粗线径特别适合容易打断球线、但又希望保持多芯线柔和手感的球员。"
  },

